funcrunch <web-goog...@funcrunch.org> wrote:

> How about making SDSM fail to reflect when covered
> by a cloak? When silver dragons first came to the
> game I was surprised that you could still get the
> full benefits of reflection when the armor was
> covered.  If the justification is that the cloak
> only covers part of the armor, then the reflection
